# units — Ring-1 stratum (ndf-the-atelier; F28: the inventory the stranger needed)
stratum units "Shared measurement units. Marker terms: a unit's identity is its hash; its doc line carries the human reading. Cited via @unit on measured fields."

term unit "The @unit attribute key: which unit a value is denominated in."
term kilogram "SI mass unit (kg)."
term hertz "SI frequency unit (Hz)."
term millilitre "One thousandth of a litre (mL)."
term metre "SI length unit (m)."
term millimetre "One thousandth of a metre (mm)."
term degree-celsius "Temperature in degrees Celsius."
term ntu "Nephelometric Turbidity Unit."
term volt "SI electric-potential unit (V)."
term watt "SI power unit (W)."
term percent "Per one hundred, dimensionless (%)."
term per-hundred "Per one hundred of the counted thing — e.g. 'per 100 bees' (F28: this doc line IS the reading; there is no per-100-bees term)."
